// The ONE place the Apple identity lives.
//
// OWNER FOLLOW-UP: bundle id com.asoc.nooz follows the owner ruling (2026-11-17,
// "Apple bundle IDs will be com.asoc.appname"). Plan rule R11 wants a NAMES.md row first;
